--></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite:_Panicked\" title=\"Eyebite: Panicked\">Eyebite: Panicked</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood-Curdling_Emission\" title=\"Blood-Curdling Emission\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood-Curdling Emission\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood-Curdling_Emission\" title=\"Blood-Curdling Emission\">Blood-Curdling Emission</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Command:_Flee\" title=\"Command: Flee\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Command_Flee_Icon.webp/20px-Command_Flee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Command_Flee_Icon.webp/30px-Command_Flee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Command_Flee_Icon.webp/40px-Command_Flee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Command: Flee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Command_Flee_Icon.webp/20px-Command_Flee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Command_Flee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Command:_Flee\" title=\"Command: Flee\">Command: Flee</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bolt_of_Celestial_Light\" title=\"Bolt of Celestial Light\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Bolt_of_Celestial_Light_Icon.webp/20px-Bolt_of_Celestial_Light_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Bolt_of_Celestial_Light_Icon.webp/30px-Bolt_of_Celestial_Light_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Bolt_of_Celestial_Light_Icon.webp/40px-Bolt_of_Celestial_Light_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bolt of Celestial Light\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Bolt_of_Celestial_Light_Icon.webp/20px-Bolt_of_Celestial_Light_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Bolt_of_Celestial_Light_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bolt_of_Celestial_Light\" title=\"Bolt of Celestial Light\">Bolt of Celestial Light</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Immolating_Gaze\" title=\"Immolating Gaze\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Immolating_Gaze_Icon.webp/20px-Immolating_Gaze_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Immolating_Gaze_Icon.webp/30px-Immolating_Gaze_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Immolating_Gaze_Icon.webp/40px-Immolating_Gaze_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immolating Gaze\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Immolating_Gaze_Icon.webp/20px-Immolating_Gaze_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Immolating_Gaze_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Immolating_Gaze\" title=\"Immolating Gaze\">Immolating Gaze</a>.</li>\n<li>The passive also provides Disadvantage against some non-expected abilities, namely <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fey_Presence:_Beguiling\" title=\"Fey Presence: Beguiling\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Fey_Presence_Icon.webp/20px-Fey_Presence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Fey_Presence_Icon.webp/30px-Fey_Presence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Fey_Presence_Icon.webp/40px-Fey_Presence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fey Presence: Beguiling\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Fey_Presence_Icon.webp/20px-Fey_Presence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Fey_Presence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fey_Presence:_Beguiling\" title=\"Fey Presence: Beguiling\">Fey Presence: Beguiling</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><i>Regarding Additional Spell Slot:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Additional Spell Slot can grant an extra spell slot once <i>per character</i> per long rest, despite the Spell Slot Depleted condition on the item.</li>\n<li>Additional Spell Slot can grant an extra spell slot multiple times to the same character if that spell slot is used to create a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/30px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/40px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png/20px-Sorcery_Points_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Sorcery_Points_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcery_Point\" title=\"Sorcery Point\">Sorcery Point</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 358px\">\n\t\